abstract: >-
  Governed Adaptive Delivery (GAD) is a human-centered hybrid method for
  AI-assisted, governed, adaptive delivery, integrating deliberate planning,
  Agile execution, AI-assisted work, evidence-based governance, and explicit
  human authority.
